  "answer": "I found no past ticket that reports this exact problem. The closest, PowerToys#291, is about the old Shortcut Guide showing no numbers when the taskbar auto-hides, and it was closed once V2 replaced that code in 0.100. Yours is a V2 bug where the indicators appear but cover the taskbar items. Please file it as a new bug with your screenshots and the 0.102 build, and say whether the indicators line up when auto-hide is off. The archive has no workaround, so for now turn off 'Automatically hide the taskbar' while you use Shortcut Guide."
